1
00:00:01,591 --> 00:00:04,100
As Uke approaches to grab with both hands

2
00:00:04,101 --> 00:00:05,179
extend your arm

3
00:00:05,180 --> 00:00:09,446
relax the arm, bring the arm in a big circular
movement in front of you

4
00:00:09,447 --> 00:00:11,968
so Uke turns completely all the way around,

5
00:00:11,969 --> 00:00:13,363
control the back of the neck

6
00:00:13,364 --> 00:00:16,122
stepping deeply and throw down.

